<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Baker Hughes upped to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Baker Hughes upped to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers Inc said it upgraded Baker Hughes Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Raised 1997 earnings estimates to $1.75 a share from $1.60 a share and the 1998 estimate to $2.20 a share from $2.00 a share.</p>
<p>-- Set 12-month price target of $46-48 a share.</p>
<p>-- Shares gained 2 to 38-5/8.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
